WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.989
At an intersection with no signs or traffic lights, two vehicles approach at the same time. Who has right of way?

00:00:07.339 --> 00:00:09.208
Whoever reaches the intersection first

00:00:09.558 --> 00:00:11.660
The vehicle coming from the right

00:00:12.010 --> 00:00:13.809
The vehicle coming from the left

00:00:14.159 --> 00:00:15.645
Both keep driving at the same time, without giving way

00:00:15.995 --> 00:00:19.153
Without signs stating otherwise, the basic rule 'right before left' applies.
